  <ids:info>
    <ids:title>BDNS two-way validation</ids:title>
    <ids:copyright>ONESTRUCTION Inc.</ids:copyright>
    <ids:version>1.0.0</ids:version>
    <ids:description>Generated by ONESTRUCTION Inc. from the buildingSMART UK&amp;I / Open Data Institute BDNS Abbreviations Register (theodi/BDNS @ fb56a0982f4177eceda2fdcf2330d5efbcd4957c), 943 rows, column 'ifc2x3'. Each register row yields a forward specification (asset code -&gt; IFC entity and description) and contributes to a reverse specification grouped by entity and PredefinedType (IFC entity -&gt; permitted asset codes). Declared schema IFC2X3; name matching exact; applicability cardinality optional. Entities and PredefinedTypes validated against the declared IFC schema with IfcOpenShell; rows not expressible in that schema are omitted rather than approximated.</ids:description>
    <ids:author>info@onestruction.com</ids:author>
    <ids:date>2026-07-27</ids:date>
    <ids:purpose>Two-way validation of BDNS asset codes against IFC entity classification</ids:purpose>
    <ids:milestone>Handover</ids:milestone>
  </ids:info>
